	(text_box "Connect a USB-C cable from a PC to the USB-C receptacle and the debug UART will enumerate as a virtual COM port.\n\nThis virtual COM port can be used to program the MPU when the boot selection switch is in the \"UART and USB\" position.\n\nThis virtual COM port can also be used as an external serial interface to the MPU."
